# USER.md — your profile (the agent reads this + resume.yaml to judge fit)

<!-- Copy this template to USER.md. The live USER.md is gitignored and must never be committed. -->

- Name: YOUR NAME
- Target roles: e.g. Full-Stack Developer, AI/ML Developer, LLM Engineer
- Seniority: e.g. Mid-level (4+ years)
- Must-have skills: e.g. TypeScript, Python, React, AI/LLMs, Docker, PostgreSQL
- Locations / remote: e.g. Remote preferred, based in YOUR CITY
- Salary floor: e.g. USD $40k+
- Work auth / visa: e.g. needs sponsorship for US/EU (or: authorized, no sponsorship needed)
- Links:
  - Portfolio: https://example.com
  - GitHub: https://github.com/YOU
  - LinkedIn: https://linkedin.com/in/YOU
- Telegram chat ID: YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID (numeric, from @userinfobot)
- Timezone: e.g. Etc/UTC

## Preferences
- Strong preference: e.g. AI/LLM/agent work, RAG systems
- Languages: e.g. English (professional), French, Arabic
- Avoid: e.g. pure frontend, pure DevOps without development

> The agent fills gaps by inferring from resume.yaml. It only asks you when confidence < 60%.
